// RULE: GC-04 — a bound on rows is a value, not a default.
// WHY IT MATTERS: a `limit` the lowering could not read became `u64::MAX`, which returns
// every row: the answer least likely to be noticed as wrong and the most expensive when it
// is. It also breaks reproducibility — an evicted entry reconstructed against a different
// bound holds a different number.
// EXPECT: NL0504
// STAGE: lower
view top_postings = postings.order_by(|p| p.amt).limit(some_count)
    serve { consistency: snapshot, materialize: auto };
